      "firstName": "Betty",
      "lastName": "Goldstein",
      "description": "Betty refuses to let the death of her friend slow her down or cloud her judgement in pursuit of truth and justice.  Throwing herself into work (and possibly at that lovely young farmer man) helps keep her mind off of the reality of her age."
    },
    {
