      "firstName": "Alexandra",
      "lastName": "O'Mackey",
      "description": "After liberating the Ginormous Gem of Summerville, Alexandra knew she would become a Dread Pirate.  Will she get the recognition she deserves or end up swabbing the decks?"
    },
    {
